5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I believe we should be very careful with our timing. I will look into the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale and the weather days in the site diaries.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to make sure we're actually helping the people who use these spaces! I'll check the booking data for specialist and general rooms and the post-occupancy review ratings.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I am concerned about the people maintaining these facilities. I'll check the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to understand which past projects actually delivered on their promises. I will examine the survey findings in the older blocks and the post-occupancy review ratings.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall focus on the financial discrepancies. I will review the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier to see if our budgets reflect reality.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Shizue,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm really excited to see what the data tells us! I think it'll be so wonderful if we can find a way to make the campus even better for everyone.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I believe a steady approach is best. Let us wait for the findings before we let our enthusiasm lead us toward any specific conclusion.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with George. We should maintain a logical approach and let the empirical evidence guide our decision rather than relying on intuition.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A most prudent suggestion, Mizuki. While Yumi's optimism is certainly refreshing, I suspect the numbers may provide a somewhat more sobering perspective on our actual capabilities. Let us see what the archives reveal.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It is so lovely to see everyone so engaged. I hope the information we find brings us a clear and peaceful path forward for our dear campus.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I agree! I just want to make sure that whoever uses the rooms is happy and that we aren't forgetting about the students' needs. I'm sure we'll find a great solution together!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"I hope so too, Yumi. However, we must remember that the happiness of the users depends entirely on the people who keep the facilities running behind the scenes. We cannot overlook the human cost.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, you are right to highlight the staff. However, we must also ensure that the facilities themselves are actually functional and valued by the users, otherwise we are wasting the staff's effort on useless spaces.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A fascinating tension between human effort and functional utility. I shall be quite interested to see if the financial reserves are sufficient to support both the staff's needs and the users' desires, or if we are merely dreaming.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us all be patient and kind to one another as we wait for the results. I am sure we will find a way to balance all these important needs together.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm so happy we're all thinking about this from different angles! I can't wait to see the results and help everyone find a perfect balance.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,George,,I agree. Let us proceed to the findings. I shall be interested to see if the staffing levels can actually support any new additions to our campus.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I believe we have covered the necessary ground for this initial phase. I look forward to seeing if the historical data reveals a pattern of disappointment or success.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. I shall await the data with a mixture of curiosity and a healthy dose of skepticism. Until then, I believe we have set a most comprehensive stage for our investigation.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
